cassini-talk (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release as Cassini talk (D45).
  * Start recording reliably when the computer is silent; say why a source
    cannot open, and leave no empty meeting when nothing opened.
  * Save silent sources as exact silence, so writing down skips them.
  * Place every track at one start for playback, transcripts and speakers (D55).
  * Set up and connect the browser companion from Cassini (0.2.13); keep
    browser recordings through reloads, on one clock with the computer's audio.
  * Add a live spectrogram, Recording details and a test recording; move
    meetings to Trash with Undo; translate into five languages.

